== Taming ==
Moose can be tamed with [[Lingonberries]], a berry from a bush found throughout the deep north. 

Like any other breedable animal in Valheim, throwing Lingonberries at a trapped Moose’s feet will start the taming process.

''For general taming information and strategies, see [[Taming|Taming.]]''

== Riding ==
Tamed Moose can be utilized as mounts. A [[Moose Saddle]] is required to ride a tamed Moose.

